### Medical Safety & Educational Use Disclaimer

CleftPath is an educational and supportive healthcare technology platform. It is NOT intended to be a substitute for professional medical advice, clinical diagnosis, surgical consultation, speech-language therapy, or treatment. Always seek the direct guidance of an accredited multidisciplinary cleft and craniofacial care team (e.g. ACPA-accredited teams) with any questions regarding medical conditions or clinical treatment plans.
